    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Chapter 3: First Contact"
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The first night was the longest Senareth had ever experienced."
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not because of duration—they had no reference point for how physical time felt compared to ethereal existence—but because of the weight of it."
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Each moment seemed to compress under its own gravity, minutes stretching into subjective hours as their newly-formed body tried to process the overwhelming cascade of sensation that darkness brought.",
      "inferred": {
        "visuals": [
          {
            "effect": "shadow_dim",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The sun had set with a finality that felt almost threatening."
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "In the Ethereal Realm, light and dark were choices—dimensional frequencies that consciousness could tune to or ignore."
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But here, darkness was a thing.",
      "inferred": {
        "visuals": [
          {
            "effect": "shadow_dim",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "An absence that pressed against their new eyes, that made the ocean sounds seem louder, that transformed the distant tree line into an impenetrable wall of uncertainty."
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Giants had withdrawn entirely once night fell."
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Even Torhh—the jade-green one whose curiosity had kept it lingering longer than the others—had finally retreated into the forest.",
      "inferred": {
        "action": [
          {
            "label": "retreat",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Senareth had watched its massive form disappear between trees that barely came to its shoulders, leaving only the faintest vibration in the earth to mark its passage.",
      "inferred": {
        "action": [
          {
            "label": "vrel_vibration",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Now two hundred Nephoretti huddled on the beach, their bioluminescent skin providing the only light beyond starshine.",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Senareth",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ],
        "visuals": [
          {
            "effect": "aurora_shimmer",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They glowed with soft blues and greens and purples—the residual vrill-energy of their manifestation expressing itself as visible radiance.",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Senareth",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ],
        "action": [
          {
            "label": "vrill_energy",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was beautiful, in a way."
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Like living auroras scattered across sand.",
      "inferred": {
        "visuals": [
          {
            "effect": "aurora_shimmer",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But it also made them vulnerable.",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Senareth",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Visible."
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Targets, if the Giants chose to see them that way.",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Senareth",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 27,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 28,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "\"We should establish shelter,\"",
      "speaker": "Vairis",
      "inferred": {
        "speaker_inferred": [
          {
            "value": "Vairis",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 29,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 30,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "\"Shelter might seem threatening,\"",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 31,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Elyraen countered, their analytical mind still focused on the Giants' reactions. \"We don't understand their territorial markers yet. Building structures might be interpreted as claiming land.\"",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Elyraen",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 32,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 33,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "\"We're already claiming land,\"",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 34,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Olythae observed quietly. They had been drawing patterns in the sand—unconscious artistic expression flowing through fingers still learning fine motor control. \"Our presence is a claim, whether we build or not.\"",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Olythae",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 35,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 36,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Senareth listened to the discussion ripple through the assembled Nephoretti."
    },
    {
      "line": 37,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Different perspectives, different priorities, all valid."
    },
    {
      "line": 38,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But beneath the surface dialogue ran a deeper current of uncertainty."
    },
    {
      "line": 39,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "None of them had expected fear.",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Senareth",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ],
        "emotion": [
          {
            "subject": "Senareth",
            "label": "fear",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 40,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The briefing—that compressed understanding of purpose they'd received during descent—had prepared them for curiosity, maybe caution.",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Senareth",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 41,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not terror.",
      "inferred": {
        "emotion": [
          {
            "subject": "Senareth",
            "label": "fear",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 42,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 43,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Why are they afraid of us?",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Senareth",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 44,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The question had repeated through Senareth's consciousness all day, finding no answer."
    },
    {
      "line": 45,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Aeon Keepers hadn't sent clarification."
    },
    {
      "line": 46,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Either they didn't know, or they were waiting for the Nephoretti to discover the truth themselves.",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Senareth",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 47,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 48,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "\"Tomorrow we try again,\"",
      "speaker": "Senareth",
      "inferred": {
        "speaker_inferred": [
          {
            "value": "Senareth",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 49,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 50,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "\"And if they flee again?\"",
      "speaker": "someone",
      "inferred": {
        "speaker_inferred": [
          {
            "value": "someone",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ],
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Senareth",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 51,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 52,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "\"Then we learn from how they flee,\"",
      "speaker": "Elyraen",
      "inferred": {
        "speaker_inferred": [
          {
            "value": "Elyraen",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ],
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Senareth",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 53,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 54,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Senareth felt gratitude ripple through their Prime connection—not from the Aeon Keepers, but from their own consciousness recognizing kindred spirit.",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Senareth",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ],
        "emotion": [
          {
            "subject": "Senareth",
            "label": "gratitude",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 55,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Elyraen understood observation, patient data collection."
    },
    {
      "line": 56,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They would be valuable in the work ahead.",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Elyraen",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 57,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 58,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "\"Rest now,\"",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 59,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Senareth instructed. \"These bodies require... what was the term?\" They searched the biological knowledge woven into their consciousness-pattern. \"Sleep. Periodic shutdown for repair and integration. We'll need full functionality tomorrow.\"",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Senareth",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 60,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 61,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Nephoretti began settling into the sand, arranging themselves in loose clusters for warmth and security."
    },
    {
      "line": 62,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Their bioluminescence dimmed as consciousness retreated inward, though never extinguishing entirely.",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Senareth",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ],
        "action": [
          {
            "label": "retreat",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 63,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Some part of them remained perpetually aware—a vestige of ethereal existence that physical form couldn't entirely override.",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Senareth",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 64,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 65,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Senareth remained awake longer, staring toward the tree line where the Giants had disappeared."
    },
    {
      "line": 66,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Somewhere in that darkness, forty-foot-tall beings made of living stone were probably watching.",
      "inferred": {
        "visuals": [
          {
            "effect": "shadow_dim",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 67,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Probably discussing in whatever way they communicated.",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Senareth",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 68,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Probably trying to understand these small glowing creatures as much as the creatures were trying to understand them.",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Senareth",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ],
        "visuals": [
          {
            "effect": "glow",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 69,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 70,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tomorrow, Senareth thought, feeling the Prime connection pulse with faint encouragement from dimensions away.",
      "inferred": {
        "visuals": [
          {
            "effect": "pulse",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 71,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tomorrow we bridge this gap."
    },
    {
      "line": 72,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 73,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 74,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 75,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Day two began with failure."
    },
    {
      "line": 76,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 77,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Senareth had selected three Nephoretti—Elyraen for observation skills, Vairis for practical thinking, and a fourth named Kyreth whose consciousness carried an unusual gentleness—to approach the tree line at first light."
    },
    {
      "line": 78,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The plan was simple: move slowly, maintain non-threatening postures, demonstrate vulnerability through deliberate exposure."
    },
    {
      "line": 79,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 80,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They made it perhaps thirty yards before the first Giant emerged from the forest—not Torhh, but a larger one whose stone-flesh carried the burnt-red coloration of desert minerals.",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Senareth",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 81,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It saw them, released a warning rumble that made the ground shake, and the entire forest seemed to pull backward.",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Senareth",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 82,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Trees swayed as multiple Giants retreated simultaneously, their massive forms creating a cascade of motion that sent birds scattering into the dawn sky.",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Senareth",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ],
        "action": [
          {
            "label": "retreat",
            "confidence": 0.9
          },
          {
            "label": "creation",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ],
        "ambiguity": 0.7
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 83,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 84,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The three Nephoretti froze, then slowly backed away."
    },
    {
      "line": 85,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No point pursuing when the reaction was so clear."
    },
    {
      "line": 86,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 87,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "\"Smaller group next time,\"",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 88,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Vairis muttered as they returned to the beach. \"Maybe just one of us.\"",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Vairis",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 89,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 90,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Day three: Elyraen went alone, moving even more slowly, stopping every few yards to kneel in what they hoped was a submissive gesture.",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Vairis",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ],
        "action": [
          {
            "label": "submission",
            "confidence": 0.3
          },
          {
            "label": "prayer",
            "confidence": 0.3
          },
          {
            "label": "observation",
            "confidence": 0.3
          }
        ],
        "ambiguity": 0.8
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 91,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Got within twenty yards of the tree line before the same burnt-red Giant appeared and drove them back with threatening gestures—massive arms swinging, fists pounding ground.",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Vairis",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 92,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 93,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Day four: Olythae tried a different approach, bringing art."
    },
    {
      "line": 94,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They arranged colored stones in patterns near the tree line—spirals and waves that mimicked natural formations.",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Vairis",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 95,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Left them as offerings, then retreated.",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Vairis",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ],
        "action": [
          {
            "label": "retreat",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 96,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The stones were still there at sunset, untouched."
    },
    {
      "line": 97,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But they weren't scattered or destroyed either.",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Vairis",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 98,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "That had to mean something."
    },
    {
      "line": 99,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 100,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Day five brought the first breakthrough, though it came by accident rather than design."
    },
    {
      "line": 101,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 102,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Kyreth had been practicing vrill-manipulation in the shallows, learning to sense the currents beneath ocean's surface.",
      "inferred": {
        "action": [
          {
            "label": "vrill_manipulation",
            "confidence": 0.9
          },
          {
            "label": "vrel_flow",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ],
        "ambiguity": 0.7
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 103,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The water responded to consciousness-touch more readily than stone or air—maybe because it was already in motion, already flowing."
    },
    {
      "line": 104,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Kyreth had managed to create small whirlpools, spirals that spun in response to focused intention.",
      "inferred": {
        "action": [
          {
            "label": "creation",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 105,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 106,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They hadn't noticed Torhh emerge from the forest.",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Kyreth",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 107,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Hadn't realized the jade-green Giant had approached to within forty feet—closer than any Giant had ventured since the landing."
    },
    {
      "line": 108,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Torhh stood at the boundary where sand met vegetation, massive body perfectly still, watching."
    },
    {
      "line": 109,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 110,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Watching the water spiral."
    },
    {
      "line": 111,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 112,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "When Kyreth finally sensed the presence and turned, terror flooded through their newly-formed nervous system.",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Torhh",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ],
        "emotion": [
          {
            "subject": "Kyreth",
            "label": "fear",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 113,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They stumbled backward, lost concentration, and the whirlpool collapsed into chaotic waves.",
      "inferred": {
        "actor": [
          {
            "value": "Torhh",
            "confidence": 0.8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 114,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 115,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But Torhh didn't advance."
    },
    {
      "line": 116,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Didn't threaten."
    },
    {
      "line": 117,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Just... stood there."
    },
    {
      "line": 118,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Those deep ocean-colored eyes fixed not on Kyreth, but on the water where the spiral had been."
    },
    {
      "line": 119,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 120,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Slowly, with movements that seemed impossible for something so massive, Torhh knelt.",
      "inferred": {
        "action": [
          {
            "label": "submission",
            "confidence": 0.3
          },
          {
